{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"0f15553c0ab3988dffc797af","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260808112551.2786782-1-lgs201920130244%40gmail.com/","channels":["linux-arm-msm"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260808112551.2786782-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260808112551.2786782-1-lgs201920130244%40gmail.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260808112551.2786782-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"},"subject":"Re: [PATCH] dmaengine: qcom: hidma: fix autosuspend cleanup during teardown","messages":{"an9pMnafob9F-Ry_@lizhi-Precision-Tower-5810":{"id":"an9pMnafob9F-Ry_@lizhi-Precision-Tower-5810","messageId":"an9pMnafob9F-Ry_@lizhi-Precision-Tower-5810","references":["20260808112551.2786782-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"],"missingAncestorIds":["20260808112551.2786782-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"],"author":{"name":"Frank Li","address":"Frank.li@oss.nxp.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Guangshuo Li","address":"lgs201920130244@gmail.com"}],"cc":[{"name":"Sinan Kaya","address":"okaya@kernel.org"},{"name":"Vinod Koul","address":"vkoul@kernel.org"},{"name":"Frank Li","address":"Frank.Li@kernel.org"},{"name":"Andy Shevchenko","address":"andy.shevchenko@gmail.com"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"dmaengine@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"stable@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-14T19:14:58.000Z","iso":"2026-08-14T19:14:58.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH] dmaengine: qcom: hidma: fix autosuspend cleanup during teardown","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-arm-msm.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On Sat, Aug 08, 2026 at 07:25:51PM +0800, Guangshuo Li wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"hidma_probe() calls pm_runtime_use_autosuspend(), but neither the probe"},{"depth":1,"text":"failure path nor hidma_remove() calls the matching"},{"depth":1,"text":"pm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend() before disabling runtime PM."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"If the autosuspend delay is set to a negative value while autosuspend"},{"depth":1,"text":"is enabled, the runtime PM core increments usage_count to prevent"},{"depth":1,"text":"runtime suspend. Without calling pm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend()"},{"depth":1,"text":"during teardown, this reference is not dropped and usage_count remains"},{"depth":1,"text":"unbalanced."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Add the missing pm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend() calls to both the"},{"depth":1,"text":"probe failure and remove paths before disabling runtime PM."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"This issue was found by manual code inspection."}],"lineCount":14,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"I seen many similar patches to fix similar problem for difference DMA\nengineer driver."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Please use devm_runtime_pm_enable() to fix it."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Frank"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Fixes: 67a2003e0607 (\"dmaengine: add Qualcomm Technologies HIDMA channel driver\")"},{"depth":1,"text":"Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org"},{"depth":1,"text":"Signed-off-by: Guangshuo Li <lgs201920130244@gmail.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"---"},{"depth":1,"text":" drivers/dma/qcom/hidma.c | 2 ++"},{"depth":1,"text":" 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"diff --git a/drivers/dma/qcom/hidma.c b/drivers/dma/qcom/hidma.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"index c939635be21d..78fd765c81e4 100644"},{"depth":1,"text":"--- a/drivers/dma/qcom/hidma.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"+++ b/drivers/dma/qcom/hidma.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"@@ -893,6 +893,7 @@ static int hidma_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)"},{"depth":1,"text":" \t\thidma_free(dmadev);"},{"depth":1,"text":" bailout:"},{"depth":1,"text":" \tpm_runtime_put_sync(&pdev->dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":"+\tpm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend(&pdev->dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":" \tpm_runtime_disable(&pdev->dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":" \treturn rc;"},{"depth":1,"text":" }"},{"depth":1,"text":"@@ -930,6 +931,7 @@ static void hidma_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":" \tdev_info(&pdev->dev, \"HI-DMA engine removed\\n\");"},{"depth":1,"text":" \tpm_runtime_put_sync_suspend(&pdev->dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":"+\tpm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend(&pdev->dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":" \tpm_runtime_disable(&pdev->dev);"},{"depth":1,"text":" }"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"--"},{"depth":1,"text":"2.43.0"},{"depth":1,"text":""}],"lineCount":31,"maximumDepth":1}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260808112551.2786782-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"}},"rootIds":["an9pMnafob9F-Ry_@lizhi-Precision-Tower-5810"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["an9pMnafob9F-Ry_@lizhi-Precision-Tower-5810"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{}}}